# Naming + evals

**Source of truth:** [`rules/deterministic.yaml`](../../rules/deterministic.yaml) (machine gate), [`rules/naming.md`](../../rules/naming.md) (HITL prose), [`repo-vend.yaml`](../../repo-vend.yaml), ADRs under `docs/adr/`.

- Prefer `intent.proposed_name` over polluted top-level purpose when resolving create name.
- Strip filler tokens (`give`, `me`, …) before kebab naming — stopwords live in `deterministic.yaml`.
- Eval prompts: `evals/extract-intent.json`, `evals/judge-naming.json` — orchestrator ≠ judge model.
- Spec Request YAML under `requests/` is SoR after Keyword Approval; vend merges then create-from-template.
- Vended README substitutes `{{REPO_NAME}}` etc.; preserve `BEGIN_TF_DOCS` / `END_TF_DOCS` markers.
- Customize via `docs/customizing.md` — do not hardcode board URLs, naming regexes, or keywords in code.
